WEBVTT

01:30.480 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.340 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 16]

01:42.560 --> 01:43.289
Miss Li Zhen.

01:43.590 --> 01:45.310
Lord Yan has a letter for you.

01:49.950 --> 01:52.950
The medicinal ink treatment
might be worth a try,

01:53.310 --> 01:54.870
but the key to this matter

01:55.150 --> 01:56.870
is Xianglan's consent.

01:57.509 --> 01:59.560
Whether my daughter
can be persuaded to agree

01:59.560 --> 02:01.480
is up to you, Miss Li Zhen.

02:02.230 --> 02:03.960
What do you think, Miss Li Zhen?

02:04.070 --> 02:05.200
Please lead the way.

02:05.350 --> 02:06.350
This way, please.

02:16.960 --> 02:17.960
Miss Yan.

02:18.870 --> 02:20.840
Using petals as decoration,

02:21.400 --> 02:23.400
though the wound hasn't healed yet,

02:24.430 --> 02:26.750
it looks beautiful.

02:27.030 --> 02:27.870
Man.

02:28.840 --> 02:30.190
My Lady, look.

02:39.000 --> 02:39.710
How is it?

02:42.750 --> 02:44.870
How did you come up with this idea?

02:45.470 --> 02:46.470
I heard that

02:46.590 --> 02:48.190
once in ancient times,

02:48.310 --> 02:49.360
an emperor's concubine

02:49.360 --> 02:51.840
accidentally hit her cheek
against a crystal screen,

02:51.840 --> 02:54.470
leaving a rather large scar.

02:55.400 --> 02:57.870
Unexpectedly, after the emperor saw it,

02:58.079 --> 03:01.080
he thought the scar
enhanced the concubine's beauty.

03:01.630 --> 03:04.590
So, the women in the palace followed suit,

03:04.870 --> 03:08.520
smearing cinnabar
and rouge on their cheeks

03:08.750 --> 03:11.430
to imitate the look
of a scar or bloodstain,

03:11.710 --> 03:13.110
creating a unique charm.

03:13.840 --> 03:15.680
Later, people named

03:15.680 --> 03:18.120
this makeup technique "Slanted Red."

03:18.470 --> 03:20.800
What you have today, Miss Yan,

03:21.079 --> 03:22.940
surpasses what "Slanted Red" is!

03:23.590 --> 03:24.520
Exactly.

03:24.520 --> 03:26.750
My Lady's beauty
is unmatched in the world.

03:26.750 --> 03:27.710
Right, My Lady?

03:27.800 --> 03:29.400
Don't make fun of me.

03:30.190 --> 03:31.560
Man is right.

03:32.000 --> 03:33.000
Miss Yan.

03:33.400 --> 03:35.000
Don't belittle yourself.

03:35.079 --> 03:36.410
You are very beautiful.

03:40.710 --> 03:42.100
You haven't had a good look around

03:42.100 --> 03:44.160
since you arrived in Huizhou, right?

03:46.430 --> 03:47.310
No.

03:47.750 --> 03:50.120
If you are free today,

03:50.590 --> 03:52.250
shall I take you out for a spin?

03:52.470 --> 03:53.190
Really?

03:54.960 --> 03:55.590
Sure!

03:55.840 --> 03:56.590
Let's go!

03:56.630 --> 03:57.280
All right!

04:06.190 --> 04:06.840
Let's go!

04:25.160 --> 04:27.070
Today is the happiest I've been

04:27.160 --> 04:28.490
since I came to Huizhou.

04:30.680 --> 04:32.920
Even when I was in the Capital,

04:33.360 --> 04:35.070
I have never been this happy.

04:36.390 --> 04:37.159
Li Zhen,

04:37.720 --> 04:38.480
thank you.

04:38.950 --> 04:40.310
If you like it, Miss Yan,

04:40.360 --> 04:42.560
I will take you around more next time.

04:49.920 --> 04:50.920
No one

04:51.720 --> 04:53.040
really wants to spend their whole life

04:53.040 --> 04:54.720
living with a veil.

04:59.159 --> 05:02.070
I recently heard that
when you were in the Capital,

05:02.430 --> 05:04.490
you actively sought medical advice.

05:04.950 --> 05:06.750
Why, after coming to Huizhou,

05:07.560 --> 05:09.220
did you refuse to get treated?

05:12.720 --> 05:14.560
If I'm not mistaken,

05:14.870 --> 05:16.120
you did all that

05:16.430 --> 05:17.830
for the sake of Lord Yan,

05:18.000 --> 05:19.390
your father, right?

05:23.720 --> 05:25.180
What are you trying to say?

05:27.000 --> 05:27.950
You are afraid

05:28.870 --> 05:31.400
that your illness
will become a burden to him,

05:32.360 --> 05:35.920
and that your father will be deceived
by people with ulterior motives.

05:35.920 --> 05:37.870
You are even more afraid that some people,

05:37.870 --> 05:39.680
once they can manipulate your illness,

05:39.680 --> 05:41.740
they can hold it against your father.

05:42.750 --> 05:44.680
Instead of letting him
spend too much time on it and worrying,

05:44.680 --> 05:46.000
it's better not to treat it,

05:46.000 --> 05:46.600
right?

05:50.040 --> 05:50.830
Li Zhen,

05:52.240 --> 05:55.000
you are indeed different

05:55.240 --> 05:56.560
from those who flatter

05:56.630 --> 05:57.720
and pander.

05:58.510 --> 05:59.310
I like it.

06:04.510 --> 06:05.600
My illness

06:06.270 --> 06:07.310
cannot be cured.

06:08.950 --> 06:10.190
So I just want

06:10.630 --> 06:12.360
my father to focus,

06:12.800 --> 06:13.920
be a good official,

06:14.270 --> 06:16.200
regain the emperor's favor early,

06:16.870 --> 06:18.330
and return to the Capital.

06:20.270 --> 06:21.390
Have you told your father

06:21.390 --> 06:22.800
this before?

06:23.160 --> 06:24.690
What's the use of saying it?

06:26.270 --> 06:29.160
If there is any chance of a cure,

06:29.430 --> 06:31.240
my father wouldn't let it go.

06:31.750 --> 06:33.920
It will only cause sadness.

06:34.190 --> 06:35.320
Better not to say it.

06:36.120 --> 06:37.120
Miss Yan.

06:37.240 --> 06:38.600
Originally, this time,

06:38.680 --> 06:40.600
I wanted to change your mind.

06:41.040 --> 06:43.100
But after hearing what you just said,

06:43.310 --> 06:44.909
I don't think your condition

06:44.950 --> 06:47.040
can be cured by this ink alone.

06:49.630 --> 06:50.390
As expected.

06:51.510 --> 06:52.800
You think so, too.

06:53.360 --> 06:55.490
The hardest thing to cure in this world

06:56.040 --> 06:56.920
is this.

06:58.190 --> 06:59.850
If the heart cannot be healed,

06:59.870 --> 07:01.400
everything else is in vain.

07:01.630 --> 07:02.830
You and the people who care about you

07:02.830 --> 07:04.560
will still torture each other—

07:04.720 --> 07:06.120
this is the real dead end.

07:20.360 --> 07:21.820
Take this ink stick first.

07:22.000 --> 07:23.190
When you have thought it through,

07:23.190 --> 07:24.250
come find me again.

07:37.480 --> 07:38.390
Xianglan.

07:38.830 --> 07:41.680
I found so many doctors for you,

07:41.870 --> 07:43.630
and you've been through
so many treatments,

07:43.630 --> 07:45.230
but they were all to no avail.

07:46.950 --> 07:48.040
The more things like this happen,

07:48.040 --> 07:49.390
the more anxious I get.

07:50.120 --> 07:51.360
I'm afraid that one day,

07:51.360 --> 07:53.159
when I am no longer in this world,

07:54.560 --> 07:57.159
there won't be anyone

07:57.830 --> 08:00.160
guarding you and protecting you like me.

08:04.430 --> 08:06.560
The hardest thing to cure in this world

08:07.160 --> 08:08.030
is this.

08:09.270 --> 08:10.930
If the heart cannot be healed,

08:10.950 --> 08:12.480
everything else is in vain.

08:12.770 --> 08:13.990
You and the people who care about you

08:13.990 --> 08:15.720
will still torture each other—

08:15.920 --> 08:17.320
this is the real dead end.

08:24.360 --> 08:25.270
Man.

08:26.430 --> 08:27.480
Tell Father

08:28.430 --> 08:29.310
to invite

08:30.270 --> 08:32.400
Ms. Li Zhen to our residence tomorrow.

08:38.320 --> 08:39.200
Miss Yan.

08:39.750 --> 08:41.880
Today is the last day of the treatment.

08:43.030 --> 08:44.200
Let's see

08:44.360 --> 08:46.240
if the facial sores have healed.

08:54.150 --> 08:55.240
Are you ready?

09:04.750 --> 09:05.670
Wait a moment.

09:17.870 --> 09:18.750
Lord Yan.

09:19.150 --> 09:20.270
How about you

09:20.270 --> 09:21.440
take off the cloth

09:21.670 --> 09:22.910
for Miss Yan?

09:34.320 --> 09:35.000
Dear.

09:35.630 --> 09:36.720
Don't be afraid.

09:41.550 --> 09:42.960
Zhen, you do it.

09:43.720 --> 09:45.000
Lord Yan, you should do it.

09:45.000 --> 09:46.030
No, you do it.

09:46.030 --> 09:47.120
No, you do it.

09:47.120 --> 09:47.440
You do it.

09:47.440 --> 09:48.000
You do it—

10:01.360 --> 10:02.150
Dear,

10:02.360 --> 10:04.240
let me see your face.

10:06.320 --> 10:07.750
It's healed!

10:10.030 --> 10:11.480
It's healed!

10:11.910 --> 10:13.120
It's healed...

10:14.030 --> 10:14.910
Look,

10:15.120 --> 10:17.390
my daughter's face is healed, isn't it?

10:18.030 --> 10:19.200
Look, dear.

10:20.720 --> 10:21.630
It's healed.

10:22.440 --> 10:23.270
It's healed.

10:23.630 --> 10:24.790
It's healed!

10:24.810 --> 10:26.410
It's healed, Father!

10:27.000 --> 10:27.910
It's healed.

10:30.240 --> 10:32.630
Thank you, Father.

10:33.890 --> 10:34.640
Ms. Li Zhen.

10:35.870 --> 10:38.150
I really don't know how to thank you.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.870
Lord Yan, you're welcome.

10:40.870 --> 10:42.240
It's what I should do.

10:44.120 --> 10:46.390
The healing effect
of your Nine-Treasure Ink

10:46.390 --> 10:48.030
is truly remarkable.

11:01.600 --> 11:02.390
Zhen,

11:03.320 --> 11:04.150
thank you!

11:07.030 --> 11:07.790
Don't cry.

11:08.000 --> 11:09.000
If you keep crying,

11:09.000 --> 11:10.600
you won't be pretty anymore.

11:11.670 --> 11:12.670
I'll stop crying.

11:12.840 --> 11:13.960
Thank you!

11:20.310 --> 11:28.820
[Li Jingfu]

11:27.010 --> 11:28.030
Jingfu,

11:29.440 --> 11:31.630
this is the medicinal ink
made by Zhen.

11:32.110 --> 11:33.080
Look.

11:33.390 --> 11:36.030
It's even better than
what you made back then.

11:39.270 --> 11:40.000
Father,

11:40.150 --> 11:41.510
for the medicinal ink,

11:41.550 --> 11:43.000
Mother took me into the mountains.

11:43.000 --> 11:43.790
She told me a lot

11:43.790 --> 11:45.720
about what happened
between you two back then.

11:45.720 --> 11:47.030
I originally thought

11:47.270 --> 11:49.200
you were only focused on making ink

11:49.220 --> 11:50.360
and were clumsy with words—

11:50.360 --> 11:52.510
not one to say anything romantic.

11:53.000 --> 11:54.060
But I didn't expect

11:54.320 --> 11:56.600
that you had already expressed
your deep affection

11:56.600 --> 11:58.360
to Mother long ago.

11:59.910 --> 12:00.960
Silly child,

12:01.720 --> 12:03.670
what do you know?

12:04.150 --> 12:05.240
Let me tell you.

12:05.360 --> 12:07.670
Your father was terrible with his words.

12:08.270 --> 12:11.670
If he really knew how to be romantic,

12:12.320 --> 12:14.440
would I complain about him every day?

12:16.920 --> 12:18.560
Mother, do you know

12:18.590 --> 12:21.360
what the Matchmaker Herb
I was looking for is?

12:23.630 --> 12:26.240
Who knows what that is?

12:26.550 --> 12:28.030
I asked you several times,

12:28.390 --> 12:30.050
but you just wouldn't tell me.

12:36.120 --> 12:39.630
This is the Matchmaker Herb
I was looking for.

12:47.390 --> 12:48.550
Isn't this

12:48.630 --> 12:50.150
the Red Phoenix Variegated Herb

12:50.150 --> 12:52.390
I used for the medicine I applied
to your father?

12:52.390 --> 12:53.360
Yes.

12:53.750 --> 12:55.240
Dad clearly knew

12:55.240 --> 12:57.480
it was called Red Phoenix Variegated Herb,

12:57.480 --> 13:00.600
but still called it Matchmaker Herb
in his notes.

13:01.750 --> 13:03.600
That's because this little herb

13:04.390 --> 13:06.170
is the matchmaker that witnessed

13:06.170 --> 13:07.900
your meeting.

13:26.440 --> 13:28.440
You're such a fool.

13:30.350 --> 13:32.040
Why didn't you...

13:32.750 --> 13:34.510
tell me these things back then?

13:38.360 --> 13:39.360
Look at you.

13:40.360 --> 13:42.760
Now you don't even have the chance
to say it.

13:44.720 --> 13:46.250
Who says there's no chance?

13:47.450 --> 13:49.970
Mother, what Father didn't get to say,

13:50.250 --> 13:51.380
I will say it for him.

13:52.360 --> 13:54.220
What Father didn't finish doing,

13:54.550 --> 13:56.630
I will continue doing it for him.

13:57.670 --> 13:58.840
From now on,

13:58.960 --> 14:00.360
the New Li's Ink Workshop

14:00.630 --> 14:02.290
will be the hope of our family.

14:02.670 --> 14:04.790
I'll work hard to make the ink I want.

14:05.000 --> 14:06.360
I want to support our family

14:06.360 --> 14:07.670
with my own abilities.

14:07.720 --> 14:09.150
I want our family to be

14:09.150 --> 14:10.240
happy.

14:18.320 --> 14:19.360
Jingfu,

14:19.750 --> 14:21.480
look at your daughter.

14:22.120 --> 14:23.780
She's so sweet with her words.

14:24.150 --> 14:26.010
You really should learn from her.

14:28.030 --> 14:28.750
Mother,

14:29.720 --> 14:31.030
this piece of ink was called

14:31.030 --> 14:33.760
Nine-Treasure Ink
by the Li family's ancestors.

14:33.960 --> 14:35.670
But since I won't return
to the main family,

14:35.670 --> 14:38.480
there's no need to call it
by its original name

14:38.480 --> 14:40.210
and cause misunderstandings.

14:40.960 --> 14:42.480
You told me before

14:42.600 --> 14:44.080
that Father used to say

14:44.150 --> 14:45.600
he wanted to use your name

14:45.600 --> 14:47.200
to name a piece of ink he made.

14:48.000 --> 14:49.930
Although Father is no longer here,

14:50.550 --> 14:51.910
the ink I make

14:52.320 --> 14:54.120
is just like the ink Father made.

15:00.510 --> 15:01.910
I will be naming this ink

15:02.270 --> 15:03.790
Fu Jin Ink

15:04.030 --> 15:05.550
to commemorate the love

15:05.630 --> 15:07.320
between you and Father.

15:26.600 --> 15:27.750
Fu Jin Ink.

15:37.720 --> 15:38.720
Jingfu.

15:40.510 --> 15:41.600
Look.

15:43.840 --> 15:45.080
This is the ink

15:45.960 --> 15:47.790
our daughter made for us.

16:03.780 --> 16:10.890
[House of New Li's Ink]

16:04.150 --> 16:05.600
Miss Li Zhen, how is it?

16:08.270 --> 16:10.320
A... A little bit more to the right.

16:10.320 --> 16:11.480
More to the right?

16:11.480 --> 16:12.260
Right, right.

16:12.260 --> 16:12.670
Miss Li Zhen,

16:12.670 --> 16:14.030
is it even now?

16:14.390 --> 16:15.840
No. This needs to be a little higher.

16:15.840 --> 16:16.510
A little higher?

16:16.510 --> 16:17.270
All right.

16:17.910 --> 16:19.870
-How about now?
-The flower has to go a little higher.

16:19.870 --> 16:20.630
A little higher?

16:20.630 --> 16:21.030
Like this?

16:21.030 --> 16:21.560
Yes, yes.

16:22.270 --> 16:23.030
Ronghua!

16:23.240 --> 16:24.200
Why are you here?

16:24.200 --> 16:25.670
I brought you some good stuff.

16:25.670 --> 16:26.510
Come in.

16:26.510 --> 16:27.080
How about this?

16:27.080 --> 16:28.280
Yes! Hang it up first.

16:28.550 --> 16:30.790
Ronghua, why did you

16:30.790 --> 16:31.910
carry this all the way here by yourself?

16:31.910 --> 16:33.080
It's so heavy.

16:33.270 --> 16:34.910
Put it down. Let me see.

16:36.910 --> 16:39.040
New Li's Ink Workshop is opening soon.

16:39.200 --> 16:41.600
I was going to
send you an invitation later,

16:41.750 --> 16:42.910
and here you are.

16:43.110 --> 16:44.360
This is great.

16:49.810 --> 16:50.600
It's great.

16:51.630 --> 16:52.390
Zhen,

16:52.440 --> 16:53.750
if only one day

16:53.750 --> 16:54.870
I could be like you,

16:54.910 --> 16:57.000
free to do what I want,

16:57.000 --> 16:58.080
how wonderful that would be.

16:58.080 --> 16:58.870
As long as you want to,

16:58.870 --> 17:00.070
you can do it anytime.

17:00.600 --> 17:03.000
Ronghua, my shop is short of hands.

17:03.030 --> 17:04.240
Do you want to come

17:04.550 --> 17:05.349
and help me?

17:05.349 --> 17:06.880
You're daydreaming again.

17:07.109 --> 17:08.680
With my father and brother around,

17:08.680 --> 17:11.079
it's hard for me
to even step into this shop.

17:12.550 --> 17:14.550
I brought you a lot of good stuff today.

17:14.550 --> 17:15.270
What is it?

17:15.270 --> 17:16.349
I can't help you out,

17:16.349 --> 17:18.349
but I have prepared everything you need.

17:18.349 --> 17:19.000
Look.

17:19.069 --> 17:20.790
This is an abacus made of agate.

17:20.790 --> 17:22.440
It's not as precious as fragrant rosewood,

17:22.440 --> 17:23.920
but it's durable.

17:23.920 --> 17:25.380
This is what I usually use.

17:26.069 --> 17:27.270
This account book, too.

17:27.270 --> 17:29.030
I had it custom-made.

17:29.690 --> 17:32.020
It's better than those sold on the market.

17:37.000 --> 17:37.880
And this.

17:37.960 --> 17:39.240
I specifically asked my mother

17:39.240 --> 17:40.900
to buy ejiao from Dong'exian.

17:41.000 --> 17:42.720
New Li's Ink Workshop is opening soon.

17:42.720 --> 17:43.550
It'll be tough on you.

17:43.550 --> 17:45.350
You must remember
to take care of yourself.

17:45.350 --> 17:47.270
Only when you are healthy,

17:47.270 --> 17:48.870
can everything go smoothly.

17:49.270 --> 17:50.680
This wooden box, too.

17:50.950 --> 17:52.100
You can use it to

17:52.130 --> 17:53.980
keep money and account books.

17:54.310 --> 17:55.880
I got you a lock too. Look.

17:58.000 --> 17:58.720
Ronghua.

18:00.590 --> 18:01.480
Thank you.

18:04.240 --> 18:05.830
If you stand on ceremony with me,

18:05.830 --> 18:06.960
I will get angry.

18:07.920 --> 18:09.110
Of course not.

18:09.160 --> 18:10.550
I will accept all of these!

18:10.550 --> 18:12.400
If any of them break in the future,

18:12.400 --> 18:15.060
I'll have to come find you,
my Goddess of Wealth.

18:15.960 --> 18:17.110
If you would like something,

18:17.110 --> 18:18.510
I wouldn't dare disobey.

18:18.670 --> 18:20.120
This is great, Zhen.

18:20.460 --> 18:21.800
Ronghua, I'll show you around.

18:21.800 --> 18:23.050
Here, put it down.

18:23.270 --> 18:23.830
This way.

18:23.850 --> 18:24.150
Okay.

18:24.150 --> 18:25.390
I did it all myself.

18:29.240 --> 18:30.000
This is...

18:30.160 --> 18:31.440
I once said,

18:31.550 --> 18:33.440
once New Li's Ink Workshop
is ready,

18:33.440 --> 18:34.880
I will personally visit

18:34.880 --> 18:36.270
to discuss with Master Qi

18:36.270 --> 18:38.270
and invite you to invest in it.

18:40.860 --> 18:44.290
[Contract]

18:49.550 --> 18:50.680
Five hundred taels.

18:51.440 --> 18:52.880
This amount is...

18:52.900 --> 18:54.900
Don't worry, Master Qi.

18:54.930 --> 18:57.130
Let me calculate it for you.

18:57.790 --> 19:00.240
We have hundreds of medicinal inks now.

19:00.310 --> 19:01.270
Even before it is finished,

19:01.270 --> 19:03.000
half of it has already been ordered.

19:03.000 --> 19:05.160
At the price of three taels of silver,

19:05.160 --> 19:06.480
even before the medicinal ink
is completely sold out,

19:06.480 --> 19:08.270
you'd already break even.

19:09.510 --> 19:12.310
Moreover, on the opening day,

19:12.310 --> 19:14.480
I have invited Lord Yan to be present.

19:14.750 --> 19:15.680
With him there,

19:15.680 --> 19:19.110
I'm sure I can sell another 100 orders
of medicinal ink.

19:20.350 --> 19:21.590
If you're not convinced,

19:21.590 --> 19:24.270
you can ask the other banks in the city.

19:24.440 --> 19:25.720
With my conditions,

19:25.720 --> 19:27.790
I bet no one would refuse.

19:29.590 --> 19:31.240
If you have no objections,

19:31.270 --> 19:33.350
let's talk about the profit distribution.

19:33.350 --> 19:34.110
Miss Li Zhen,

19:34.960 --> 19:36.110
I'll keep this contract

19:36.110 --> 19:37.110
for now.

19:37.720 --> 19:39.680
But if you want those five hundred taels,

19:39.680 --> 19:41.410
you have to meet someone first.

19:46.960 --> 19:49.030
Madam, Miss Li Zhen has arrived.

19:50.070 --> 19:51.550
Miss Li Zhen, please.

19:59.790 --> 20:01.590
Miss Li Zhen, please take a seat.

20:06.790 --> 20:09.240
Miss Li Zhen, do you know who I am?

20:10.090 --> 20:11.850
Cuiqiao Cottage's Madam Wang.

20:11.310 --> 20:15.830
[Madam (Da Gu): a polite way
to address ladies in ancient times.]

20:11.920 --> 20:13.650
Everyone in Huizhou knows you.

20:16.230 --> 20:20.200
Opening an ink workshop and becoming
a manager at such a young age—

20:21.160 --> 20:22.200
Miss Li Zhen,

20:22.920 --> 20:24.650
you are indeed extraordinary.

20:27.550 --> 20:28.880
Madam Wang, you invited me here

20:28.880 --> 20:29.920
because of Master Qi's

20:29.920 --> 20:32.350
investment in New Li's Ink Workshop,
right?

20:32.350 --> 20:34.720
You are straightforward and frank, Miss.

20:35.350 --> 20:36.920
I have one thing to ask.

20:37.200 --> 20:40.310
It's difficult for a woman
to tread through the world of business.

20:40.310 --> 20:42.720
Doing ink for Li Ink quietly

20:42.830 --> 20:45.310
could've been a good choice.

20:45.550 --> 20:47.880
Why did you choose the difficult path

20:47.970 --> 20:50.930
of opening your own ink workshop?

20:52.920 --> 20:56.030
Madam Wang, your business reputation
resonates throughout the Nine Provinces.

20:56.030 --> 20:58.880
Once upon a time,
you must have made the same choice

20:58.920 --> 21:00.440
as I did.

21:01.160 --> 21:02.510
May I ask—

21:02.640 --> 21:06.030
have you ever regretted that choice?

21:10.750 --> 21:12.480
You are indeed quick-witted, Miss.

21:12.480 --> 21:13.680
Have some tea.

21:22.880 --> 21:25.440
Madam, the tea merchants have arrived.

21:25.640 --> 21:27.640
Please go over and appraise the tea.

21:29.840 --> 21:31.420
Since Miss Li Zhen is also here,

21:31.420 --> 21:32.230
why not help

21:32.250 --> 21:33.980
with choosing the tea?

21:36.350 --> 21:37.880
I don't know much about tea.

21:38.100 --> 21:40.070
How could I dare
to decide this for Madam Wang?

21:40.070 --> 21:42.640
It doesn't matter. Just follow your heart.

21:43.960 --> 21:46.310
All right then, I shall have a go.

21:47.160 --> 21:48.220
Madam Wang is here.

21:48.640 --> 21:50.900
-Hello, Madam Wang.
-Hello, Madam Wang.

21:51.110 --> 21:54.480
Today, Miss Li Zhen
will select the tea for me.

21:56.070 --> 21:56.680
All right!

21:58.960 --> 22:00.160
Whose tea is this?

22:01.070 --> 22:02.920
This is West Lake Longjing.

22:03.000 --> 22:05.200
The leaves are yellow-green and glossy

22:05.880 --> 22:07.010
with a strong aroma.

22:07.200 --> 22:10.200
It is the top choice for literati
to entertain guests.

22:15.160 --> 22:16.640
This is Dongting Bi Luo Chun—

22:16.640 --> 22:18.160
also known as "Astoundingly Fragrant."

22:18.160 --> 22:19.760
It has a silver-green color,

22:19.790 --> 22:22.320
and overflows with fragrance
after brewing.

22:33.480 --> 22:35.030
Junshan Silver Needle.

22:35.160 --> 22:37.110
This is a yellow tea,

22:37.640 --> 22:39.270
with an orange-yellow core.

22:39.480 --> 22:40.480
It's also known as...

22:40.480 --> 22:41.440
That's enough.

22:41.440 --> 22:42.480
I got it.

22:42.550 --> 22:43.310
Thank you.

22:44.750 --> 22:45.480
Miss.

22:45.480 --> 22:48.590
This is Yunnan's Pu'er.

22:48.960 --> 22:51.490
It comes from the same source
as a tribute tea.

22:51.880 --> 22:52.680
Pu'er?

22:53.310 --> 22:54.030
Good tea.

23:02.400 --> 23:05.750
Sir, compared to other teas,

23:05.790 --> 23:07.200
this tea of yours is not as refined.

23:07.200 --> 23:08.400
What kind of tea is it?

23:10.070 --> 23:11.160
Miss,

23:11.440 --> 23:13.640
this is Wild Tea from Houkeng.

23:14.470 --> 23:15.400
Wild tea?

23:17.160 --> 23:18.030
Houkeng?

23:18.590 --> 23:20.310
if my memory serves me right,

23:20.400 --> 23:22.440
it's in Taipingxian, Ningguofu, right?

23:22.440 --> 23:23.240
Exactly.

23:23.440 --> 23:27.000
Miss, although this is a Wild Tea

23:27.240 --> 23:29.270
and looks ordinary,

23:29.590 --> 23:30.590
after brewing,

23:31.240 --> 23:33.040
it has a strong orchid fragrance

23:33.510 --> 23:34.970
and a sweet, mellow taste.

23:38.270 --> 23:40.790
Have a taste, it's very delicious.

23:46.640 --> 23:48.510
This is the good tea you chose?

23:49.160 --> 23:50.640
Yes, this is the one.

23:52.750 --> 23:55.150
There were so many good teas
to choose from,

23:55.550 --> 23:56.680
why did you pick

23:56.680 --> 23:58.350
this ordinary Wild Tea?

23:59.440 --> 24:01.510
I only know how to make ink,

24:01.680 --> 24:04.000
yet you asked me to appraise tea today.

24:04.070 --> 24:05.200
At the end of the day,

24:05.240 --> 24:06.920
it's a test of

24:06.920 --> 24:08.480
my vision and knowledge,

24:08.680 --> 24:09.440
isn't it?

24:10.750 --> 24:11.920
Then tell me,

24:12.030 --> 24:13.920
why did you choose this Wild Tea?

24:15.510 --> 24:18.110
In business, profit comes first.

24:18.200 --> 24:20.800
Making money
is naturally the most important.

24:20.960 --> 24:22.310
So I think

24:22.400 --> 24:23.750
it doesn't matter

24:23.750 --> 24:25.480
if the 5 types of tea today
is good or bad.

24:25.480 --> 24:26.720
What's important is

24:26.830 --> 24:28.550
I know this Houkeng Wild Tea

24:28.550 --> 24:30.440
has a unique advantage.

24:31.590 --> 24:32.750
What may that be?

24:33.200 --> 24:34.800
It originates from Houkeng.

24:34.880 --> 24:37.590
Houkeng is at the northern foot
of Mount Huangshan,

24:37.590 --> 24:38.680
close to Huizhou.

24:38.790 --> 24:41.720
It was also brought here
by the village head himself.

24:41.880 --> 24:44.480
Buying from the source leaves more profit.

24:46.350 --> 24:48.200
Just like those ink merchants—

24:48.590 --> 24:50.000
it's the same principle as why

24:50.000 --> 24:52.030
they have to travel a long way to Huizhou

24:52.030 --> 24:53.490
if they want to buy Hui Ink.

24:59.440 --> 25:02.750
I think it's the same for tea and ink.

25:03.440 --> 25:05.160
Before being polished,

25:05.200 --> 25:06.550
they look ordinary.

25:06.590 --> 25:09.240
Once polished, they are extraordinary.

25:09.400 --> 25:10.960
And the village head told me

25:10.960 --> 25:13.830
this tea has an orchid scent.

25:13.920 --> 25:16.350
If pressed into the shape of an orchid,

25:16.510 --> 25:19.200
its appearance will surely be
a hundred times better than now,

25:19.200 --> 25:21.270
and the profit goes without saying.

25:32.150 --> 25:34.070
Miss Li Zhen, you have good judgment.

25:34.070 --> 25:36.440
I will have someone deliver
the 500 taels of silver

25:36.440 --> 25:39.030
for New Li's ink workshop
to your residence.

25:40.720 --> 25:41.980
Thank you, Madam Wang.

25:42.830 --> 25:44.110
Sister, how was it?

25:44.640 --> 25:46.720
I really like this Miss Li Zhen.

25:47.000 --> 25:50.200
I have already sent
the 500 taels of silver on your behalf.

25:50.790 --> 25:51.750
I asked you to come here

25:51.750 --> 25:53.830
because there is another urgent matter.

25:53.830 --> 25:55.110
I have found the Gao Kun

25:55.160 --> 25:56.490
you asked me to look for.

25:56.990 --> 25:59.190
He is now in Xu Village on Mount Jinlong.

26:04.200 --> 26:06.830
This Gao Kun
is indeed Zhao Shen's confidant.

26:06.920 --> 26:10.850
Catching him will definitely bring down
Zhao Shen and the Tian family.

26:23.200 --> 26:23.920
Lord Yan.

26:24.200 --> 26:25.070
Lord Yan.

26:26.480 --> 26:28.070
Zhen, congratulations.

26:28.070 --> 26:28.750
Thank you, Lord Yan!

26:28.750 --> 26:30.030
Greetings, Lord Yan.

26:30.160 --> 26:31.240
Lord Yan!

26:31.680 --> 26:32.830
You look well.

26:32.830 --> 26:34.490
Thank you for the compliment.

26:34.920 --> 26:35.750
Lord Yan.

26:36.240 --> 26:38.680
You were at the completion

26:38.680 --> 26:39.830
of the ancient lacquer-soot ink

26:39.830 --> 26:42.110
to see things through
from beginning to end.

26:42.110 --> 26:44.640
This is just a small ink workshop opening.

26:44.750 --> 26:47.400
To have Lord Yan come in person—

26:48.070 --> 26:50.590
what an honor

26:51.030 --> 26:52.200
to Zhen!

26:52.200 --> 26:53.110
You flatter me!

26:53.160 --> 26:54.020
You flatter me.

26:54.790 --> 26:55.640
Lord Yan.

26:55.790 --> 26:57.440
Since you are here today,

26:57.440 --> 26:59.310
I wonder if you can write a calligraphy

26:59.310 --> 27:00.160
for New Li's Ink Workshop

27:00.160 --> 27:01.480
to be passed down to future generations?

27:01.480 --> 27:03.400
Zhen, to be honest,

27:03.510 --> 27:05.640
I was just... thinking the same thing!

27:07.680 --> 27:08.440
Great!

27:15.030 --> 27:15.720
Zhen.

27:18.550 --> 27:20.150
This is such a grand opening,

27:20.640 --> 27:22.400
but you don't have much ink in stock.

27:22.400 --> 27:23.930
What if too many people come

27:23.960 --> 27:25.030
and you can't supply enough ink?

27:25.030 --> 27:25.750
What should we do then?

27:25.750 --> 27:26.960
Mother, don't worry.

27:26.960 --> 27:28.160
I know what I'm doing.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.160
Zhen.

27:43.520 --> 27:45.060
Fu Jin Ink!

27:45.640 --> 27:46.160
Bravo!

27:46.550 --> 27:48.030
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

27:48.440 --> 27:50.480
I'm embarrassing myself.

27:51.270 --> 27:53.110
Official Fan has arrived.

27:53.920 --> 27:54.510
Official Fan?

27:54.510 --> 27:56.040
Official Fan, you're here.

27:58.030 --> 27:59.270
Official Fan!

28:01.830 --> 28:02.640
Miss Li Zhen.

28:02.720 --> 28:03.550
Official Fan.

28:03.750 --> 28:05.790
Qi Jiu couldn't come himself,

28:05.790 --> 28:08.240
so he insisted I come to congratulate
Miss Li Zhen for him.

28:08.240 --> 28:08.960
Thank you.

28:09.790 --> 28:12.960
Since Lord Yan personally wrote
the calligraphy for Fu Jin Ink,

28:12.960 --> 28:14.440
even if the stock is not fully ready,

28:14.440 --> 28:17.200
I would like to order 100 sticks

28:17.550 --> 28:20.830
to add some joy
to New Li's Ink Workshop's opening.

28:22.550 --> 28:24.270
What do you think, Miss Li?

28:25.350 --> 28:26.920
Certainly!

28:28.000 --> 28:29.480
If you are willing

28:29.480 --> 28:31.720
to take only 40 sticks first,

28:31.790 --> 28:33.240
I am willing to give

28:33.440 --> 28:36.570
a 30% discount,
for the remaining 60 sticks. How's that?

28:37.590 --> 28:38.240
Of course!

28:38.270 --> 28:39.270
Good!

28:39.750 --> 28:41.750
Since you are willing to give a discount,

28:41.750 --> 28:44.070
I'll purchase another 50 sticks.

28:44.530 --> 28:45.420
Great!

28:47.480 --> 28:49.270
Since Official Fan has spoken,

28:49.440 --> 28:50.790
I'll order another 50!

28:51.110 --> 28:51.750
Thank you.

28:51.750 --> 28:53.200
I'll add 50 more too!

28:53.480 --> 28:54.680
Thank you, everyone.

28:54.790 --> 28:55.990
Thank you, everyone.

28:57.640 --> 28:58.550
Miss Li Zhen.

28:59.160 --> 29:00.350
It is time.

29:00.400 --> 29:02.070
Let's open for business.

29:19.000 --> 29:19.720
All right!

29:20.480 --> 29:21.880
New Li's Ink Workshop

29:22.200 --> 29:23.750
is officially open!

29:23.750 --> 29:25.960
-Great!
-Great!

29:33.600 --> 29:38.330
[House of New Li's Ink]

29:45.510 --> 29:46.270
Zhen.

29:47.510 --> 29:49.070
There were many guests

29:49.160 --> 29:51.220
at the ink workshop's opening today.

29:51.920 --> 29:53.580
I saw you were extremely busy,

29:55.030 --> 29:57.630
so I didn't pass you
this congratulatory gift.

30:03.240 --> 30:04.240
What is this?

30:05.550 --> 30:07.150
Open it and see for yourself.

30:08.030 --> 30:09.890
This inkstone has a fine texture.

30:10.270 --> 30:12.200
It works best with medicinal ink.

30:13.200 --> 30:14.160
Who gave this?

30:22.350 --> 30:25.710
[For my granddaughter, Li Zhen]

31:16.480 --> 31:19.810
[Fu Jin Ink]

31:37.400 --> 31:39.310
You made it.

31:39.480 --> 31:40.830
You actually...

31:40.830 --> 31:42.880
You actually made it.

31:43.240 --> 31:44.110
You made it.

31:45.750 --> 31:46.750
Third Brother.

31:46.790 --> 31:49.160
How are you still
in the mood to drink here?

31:57.400 --> 31:58.480
Tell me.

31:58.680 --> 32:00.350
We went through so much trouble

32:00.350 --> 32:02.280
putting up all sorts of obstacles.

32:02.440 --> 32:03.030
But Li Zhen

32:03.030 --> 32:05.830
still managed to establish
New Li's Ink Workshop.

32:07.680 --> 32:08.750
Not only that,

32:09.240 --> 32:11.700
she also created
some kind of medicinal ink.

32:11.880 --> 32:13.160
I heard that for today's opening,

32:13.160 --> 32:14.070
the Ink Affairs Official and his daughter

32:14.070 --> 32:15.960
both went in person to back her up.

32:16.400 --> 32:18.000
Who does she think she is?

32:23.030 --> 32:24.760
Third Brother, I'm asking you.

32:24.960 --> 32:26.270
Why didn't you go stop

32:26.270 --> 32:28.240
New Li's Ink Workshop's opening today?

32:28.240 --> 32:29.270
We should've sent someone

32:29.270 --> 32:31.000
to smash her shop.

32:33.680 --> 32:35.270
Smash her shop?

32:37.270 --> 32:39.530
On what grounds should we smash her shop?

32:40.440 --> 32:42.510
Did she use your pine soot

32:42.510 --> 32:44.720
or your glue?

32:47.200 --> 32:49.590
You took back the old ink workshop.

32:50.680 --> 32:52.680
That's because it belongs to our family—

32:52.680 --> 32:54.160
perfectly justifiable.

32:55.270 --> 32:58.070
But what right do you have
to New Li's Ink Workshop?

32:58.480 --> 33:00.880
The recipe is her own.

33:00.960 --> 33:02.680
The staff are her own.

33:03.000 --> 33:05.790
She didn't even use
her own grandfather's help.

33:07.110 --> 33:08.830
You want to smash her shop?

33:09.400 --> 33:12.270
Am I some bully or bandit?

33:14.830 --> 33:17.640
Third Brother,
how much have you had to drink?

33:17.790 --> 33:18.480
You...

33:18.720 --> 33:20.790
You're speaking up for her?

33:27.400 --> 33:28.750
Hey, what is this?

33:29.930 --> 33:31.920
[To Uncle Jingdong,
Invitation to New Li's Ink Workshop's opening]

33:37.000 --> 33:38.590
This is that medicinal ink?

33:39.200 --> 33:41.160
Li Zhen is so bold.

33:41.510 --> 33:43.710
How dare she send ink here to provoke us!

33:44.440 --> 33:46.310
Who said she sent it?

33:48.550 --> 33:50.000
I...

33:50.160 --> 33:52.000
I...

33:54.110 --> 33:55.920
I bought this ink...

33:56.640 --> 33:59.000
for 3 times the price

33:59.240 --> 34:01.590
from an ink merchant.

34:03.350 --> 34:05.160
I just wanted to see

34:05.350 --> 34:08.670
if Li Zhen could really create

34:08.690 --> 34:10.620
the Nine-Treasure Medicinal Ink.

34:12.960 --> 34:13.630
She did.

34:14.230 --> 34:15.510
Have you lost your mind?

34:15.510 --> 34:16.150
She did.

34:17.070 --> 34:17.840
She did...

34:18.510 --> 34:19.630
She really did.

34:21.150 --> 34:22.960
You really have lost your mind.

34:22.960 --> 34:25.030
It's just a piece of medicinal ink.

34:25.190 --> 34:26.800
So what?

34:28.550 --> 34:30.070
So what?

34:33.190 --> 34:35.070
So what?

34:36.840 --> 34:39.360
I'll tell you what.

34:40.480 --> 34:43.710
I, Li Jingdong,
have made ink my whole life,

34:43.710 --> 34:46.920
but I can't make this piece of ink.

34:49.590 --> 34:51.670
So what?

34:52.800 --> 34:54.070
So...

34:55.480 --> 34:56.190
Go.

34:57.630 --> 34:58.440
Leave.

34:59.880 --> 35:02.590
Let me be alone for a while.

35:03.880 --> 35:04.550
Go.

35:05.150 --> 35:06.230
Third Brother.

35:09.150 --> 35:11.440
I'm making it clear today.

35:11.760 --> 35:13.550
If you tolerate her,

35:13.630 --> 35:15.560
you're raising a threat yourself.

35:16.400 --> 35:17.920
Today, she sends the invitation here

35:17.920 --> 35:19.440
showing off.

35:19.440 --> 35:20.360
Soon enough,

35:20.360 --> 35:22.160
New Li will take over the main Li.

35:22.230 --> 35:24.320
The family temple, ancestral hall,
and ink workshop

35:24.320 --> 35:26.920
will all change their names
but not their surname.

35:26.920 --> 35:28.480
Then the Li family
will be the biggest joke

35:28.480 --> 35:30.590
in Huizhou ever.

35:33.960 --> 35:35.230
Don't you regret it.

35:44.480 --> 35:45.190
No...

35:49.190 --> 35:50.550
It's truly ridiculous.

35:51.110 --> 35:52.320
A woman

35:52.800 --> 35:54.360
opened an ink workshop?

35:54.590 --> 35:57.440
What a disgrace to Hui Ink.

35:57.590 --> 35:58.480
Right.

35:58.710 --> 36:00.960
She is also promoting some medicinal ink

36:00.960 --> 36:03.820
called Nine-Treasure something
as her signature.

36:03.910 --> 36:04.770
I heard from others

36:04.770 --> 36:06.800
that this ink
has been lost for over a century.

36:06.800 --> 36:08.670
I don't believe she can create it.

36:10.920 --> 36:13.110
It must be a fake.

36:17.880 --> 36:20.400
Wh-Why don't I get someone
to buy a few pieces,

36:20.400 --> 36:21.710
and claim it ruined their health?

36:21.710 --> 36:24.170
That will surely ruin
New Li's Ink Workshop.

36:26.800 --> 36:28.280
It's just a small ink workshop.

36:28.280 --> 36:29.760
You don't have to bother.

36:31.670 --> 36:32.630
These days,

36:33.150 --> 36:34.710
Lord Yan has been looking after Li Zhen

36:34.710 --> 36:36.230
because she cured

36:36.550 --> 36:38.150
Miss Yan's chronic illness.

36:38.230 --> 36:38.800
If you go now,

36:38.800 --> 36:41.230
you might just bring trouble
upon yourself.

36:41.230 --> 36:43.150
I'll have someone else go.

36:45.440 --> 36:46.110
Master.

36:47.440 --> 36:49.570
A letter has arrived from the Capital.

37:04.320 --> 37:05.480
Great!

37:07.030 --> 37:09.000
This is truly joyous news

37:09.400 --> 37:11.510
for our Tian family.

37:11.920 --> 37:13.650
Master, what joyous news is it?

37:13.880 --> 37:15.230
I've found our daughter

37:15.230 --> 37:18.590
an excellent match in the Capital.

37:19.190 --> 37:19.920
Really?

37:22.030 --> 37:24.630
I was just worrying
about Ronghua's marriage.

37:24.710 --> 37:25.770
This is wonderful.

37:26.320 --> 37:27.440
Whose son is it?

37:27.590 --> 37:28.720
He is the grandson of

37:29.190 --> 37:30.840
Lord Xu from the Capital.

37:31.760 --> 37:32.960
As far as I know,

37:33.480 --> 37:34.510
this Lord Xu

37:35.070 --> 37:36.550
dotes on his only daughter

37:36.550 --> 37:37.670
very much.

37:38.440 --> 37:39.550
Lord Xu?

37:40.320 --> 37:41.840
If our Tian family

37:42.110 --> 37:43.840
can secure this marriage,

37:44.670 --> 37:48.000
we'll have a backer in the Capital.

37:48.800 --> 37:49.670
In the future,

37:50.320 --> 37:51.780
it will be of great benefit

37:52.000 --> 37:53.320
to our Tian Ink.

37:53.800 --> 37:56.550
Our Tian Ink will be able to thrive.

37:58.360 --> 38:00.550
Then... Then, when I go out drinking,

38:00.590 --> 38:01.320
won't everyone

38:01.320 --> 38:02.710
have to defer to me?

38:02.960 --> 38:04.960
Just thinking about it feels great.

38:06.550 --> 38:07.110
Father.

38:08.230 --> 38:09.710
Lord Xu is no ordinary man.

38:10.840 --> 38:12.500
Would such a prominent family

38:12.710 --> 38:13.760
really be willing to marry someone

38:13.760 --> 38:15.620
from a merchant family like ours?

38:18.110 --> 38:20.400
Brother, what a party pooper you are.

38:21.000 --> 38:22.550
What's wrong with our family?

38:22.550 --> 38:24.480
Since ancient times,
officials and merchants are distinct.

38:24.480 --> 38:26.000
The divide is as deep as a chasm.

38:26.000 --> 38:27.880
If you don't understand, shut up.

38:33.440 --> 38:34.230
Master.

38:35.440 --> 38:37.070
Chang is right.

38:38.800 --> 38:40.330
How could a family like that

38:40.630 --> 38:42.320
take a fancy to us?

38:42.360 --> 38:44.760
It's not about whether they fancy us,

38:44.920 --> 38:47.110
it's whether we fancy them.

38:50.440 --> 38:51.400
Rumor has it

38:51.800 --> 38:54.070
that when this child was young, a fever

38:54.440 --> 38:55.630
damaged his brain.

38:56.320 --> 38:57.190
That's why

38:57.550 --> 38:59.480
he's still not engaged at this age.

38:59.590 --> 39:01.110
This is also why we have

39:01.400 --> 39:04.190
the chance to secure this marriage.

39:06.800 --> 39:09.670
Master, he has a damaged brain?

39:10.670 --> 39:12.590
Then he's a fool!

39:14.150 --> 39:15.030
I don't think

39:15.440 --> 39:17.710
it's that serious.

39:21.960 --> 39:23.150
Then again,

39:23.360 --> 39:25.360
if there's nothing wrong with this child,

39:25.360 --> 39:26.440
such a good thing

39:26.480 --> 39:29.140
would never fall into the lap
of our Tian family.

39:29.360 --> 39:29.800
No way!

39:29.800 --> 39:31.590
Father, I won't marry him!

39:33.510 --> 39:35.670
You already treated me
like an object once.

39:35.670 --> 39:37.670
Are you going to
repeat the same mistake today

39:37.670 --> 39:39.190
and do it to me a second time?

39:39.190 --> 39:40.400
What nonsense!

39:40.670 --> 39:41.880
Is this

39:42.000 --> 39:43.200
the same as last time?

39:44.760 --> 39:46.670
Do you know how much money

39:47.030 --> 39:48.360
and effort I've spent

39:48.840 --> 39:50.360
for this marriage?

39:50.670 --> 39:52.590
For the honor of our Tian family,

39:53.110 --> 39:55.110
you will marry him

39:55.400 --> 39:56.360
whether you

39:56.760 --> 39:57.630
want to or not.

39:58.760 --> 39:59.590
Master.

40:00.480 --> 40:02.110
Please don't get mad.

40:02.320 --> 40:04.800
Can we take our time to discuss this?

40:04.800 --> 40:06.030
Discuss what?

40:07.510 --> 40:09.360
What a bunch of useless fools.

40:09.710 --> 40:11.510
There's no need to discuss this.

40:11.590 --> 40:12.920
My word is final.

40:13.630 --> 40:14.320
Chang.

40:15.230 --> 40:15.960
Sheng.

40:16.480 --> 40:17.630
You two stay at home

40:17.760 --> 40:19.510
and keep a close eye on your sister.

40:19.510 --> 40:20.910
Don't let her run around.

40:21.630 --> 40:23.030
Just stay at home

40:23.320 --> 40:25.070
and stop letting
your imagination run wild.

40:25.070 --> 40:26.400
Once we get word from the Capital,

40:26.400 --> 40:27.510
we'll leave

40:27.920 --> 40:29.850
and you'll get married right away.

40:32.590 --> 40:33.480
Master.

40:34.070 --> 40:34.670
You...

40:42.630 --> 40:43.510
Is Master back?

40:43.800 --> 40:44.480
Where is he?

40:44.550 --> 40:45.230
Inside.

40:45.670 --> 40:46.440
Master!

40:48.150 --> 40:49.150
You're injured.

40:49.600 --> 40:51.060
I'll go get some medicine.

40:52.800 --> 40:53.630
Rouge ink.

40:53.800 --> 40:54.730
Just apply this.

40:56.550 --> 40:58.150
Gao Kun is very cunning.

40:58.800 --> 41:00.960
It took a lot of effort to catch him.

41:01.070 --> 41:02.190
He's locked up now.

41:06.190 --> 41:07.250
By the way, Master,

41:07.320 --> 41:09.440
you weren't at
the House of New Li's Ink's opening.

41:09.440 --> 41:11.570
Miss Li Zhen should be there right now.

41:11.630 --> 41:12.630
It's not far away.

41:12.960 --> 41:14.110
How about we go take a look?

41:14.110 --> 41:14.760
No need.

41:15.230 --> 41:16.160
Business first.

41:27.800 --> 41:30.300
[Huizhou Prefecture Office]

41:31.320 --> 41:33.110
Master Qi, what brings you here

41:33.110 --> 41:34.150
for a visit?

41:34.800 --> 41:35.440
Lord He.

41:36.070 --> 41:37.200
Sorry to bother you.

41:38.020 --> 41:40.950
Please take a look at these.

41:39.890 --> 41:43.200
[Magistrate of Huizhou,
He Wenchang]

41:43.570 --> 41:44.390
[Account Ledger of Revenues
and Expenditures of Shexian Prefecture]

41:53.110 --> 41:54.000
Master Qi,

41:55.320 --> 41:57.320
what are you trying to say

41:57.440 --> 41:58.630
showing me this?

41:59.110 --> 41:59.880
Lord He,

42:00.070 --> 42:01.510
you've just arrived in Huizhou,

42:01.510 --> 42:03.510
so you might not be fully aware
of the situation.

42:03.510 --> 42:05.190
Zhao Shen, Magistrate Zhao,

42:05.400 --> 42:07.360
has been taking bribes for years.

42:07.590 --> 42:08.880
He abuses his power

42:09.110 --> 42:10.570
and oppresses the locals.

42:11.280 --> 42:13.670
Every single detail is recorded here.

42:13.920 --> 42:16.320
Please judge wisely.

42:21.400 --> 42:23.840
This is no small matter.

42:24.440 --> 42:27.670
Master Qi, you must act with caution.

42:27.840 --> 42:29.760
Handling a case requires evidence—

42:29.760 --> 42:31.800
both witnesses and material evidence.

42:31.800 --> 42:34.920
If we only rely on these account books,

42:35.630 --> 42:38.230
I'm afraid they might
be suspected of forgery.

42:38.670 --> 42:40.330
Lord He, given your position,

42:40.510 --> 42:43.170
it's perfectly normal
for you to have concerns.

42:43.960 --> 42:45.360
But please rest assured, My Lord.

42:45.360 --> 42:47.030
Besides this evidence,

42:47.510 --> 42:49.510
the confidants who helped Zhao Shen

42:50.190 --> 42:52.000
have also been captured by us.

42:52.030 --> 42:52.840
What?

42:53.670 --> 42:54.110
You...

42:56.000 --> 42:57.670
You are just a merchant.

42:57.670 --> 42:59.870
How can you act on behalf of His Majesty?

43:00.400 --> 43:01.070
Qi Jiu,

43:01.360 --> 43:04.070
your actions are truly a transgression.
